{"ref":"BDB, בִּכְרִי","hw":"בִּכְרִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בִּכְרִי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>youthful</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  a Benjamite <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.1\">2 S 20:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:13\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.22\">22</a>; only in phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁבַע בֶּן־בִּכְרִי</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  perhaps <strong>adj.gent.</strong> pl. c. art. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַבִּכְרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.14\">2 S 20:14</a> <em>the Bichrites</em> (i.e. family of Shebaʿ), MT <span dir=\"rtl\">הַבֵּרִים</span>; cf. 𝔊 ἐν Χαρρει = <span dir=\"rtl\">(ב)כרי</span>; so Klo Dr.","next":"BDB, בִּכְרָה","prev":"BDB, בֹּֽכְרוּ"}